flowchart TD
    PREFLIGHT[PRE_FLIGHT_CHECK] -->|CHECKS_PASSED| DRAFT_SETUP[GENERATING_EXECUTION_SETUP_PLAN]
    DRAFT_SETUP -->|DRAFT_READY_OR_REVIEWABLE_INVALID| SETUP_APPROVAL[WAITING_EXECUTION_SETUP_APPROVAL]
    SETUP_APPROVAL -->|REGENERATE| DRAFT_SETUP
    SETUP_APPROVAL -->|APPROVE| PREPARE[PREPARING_EXECUTION_ENV]
    PREPARE -->|EVIDENCE_CHANGED_OR_EDIT| SETUP_APPROVAL
    PREPARE -->|REGENERATE| DRAFT_SETUP
    PREPARE -->|EXECUTION_SETUP_READY| CODING[CODING]
    CODING -->|BEAD_COMPLETE| CODING
    CODING -->|ALL_BEADS_DONE| FINAL_TEST[RUNNING_FINAL_TEST]
    FINAL_TEST -->|MANUAL_QA_ENABLED| QA_GENERATE[GENERATING_QA_CHECKLIST]
    QA_GENERATE --> QA[WAITING_MANUAL_QA]
    QA -->|FAIL| CODING
    QA -->|PASS_WAIVE_OR_SKIP| INTEGRATE[INTEGRATING_CHANGES]
    FINAL_TEST -->|TESTS_PASSED_AND_QA_DISABLED| INTEGRATE
    INTEGRATE -->|INTEGRATION_DONE| CREATE_PR[CREATING_PULL_REQUEST]
    CREATE_PR -->|PULL_REQUEST_READY| PR_REVIEW[WAITING_PR_REVIEW]
    PR_REVIEW -->|MERGE_OR_CLOSE_UNMERGED| CLEANUP[CLEANING_ENV]
    CLEANUP -->|CLEANUP_DONE| DONE[COMPLETED]

    PREFLIGHT -. ERROR .-> ERROR[BLOCKED_ERROR]
    DRAFT_SETUP -. OPERATIONAL_ERROR .-> ERROR
    PREPARE -. ERROR .-> ERROR
    CODING -. ERROR .-> ERROR
    FINAL_TEST -. ERROR .-> ERROR
    QA_GENERATE -. ERROR .-> ERROR
    QA -. ERROR .-> ERROR
    INTEGRATE -. ERROR .-> ERROR
    CREATE_PR -. ERROR .-> ERROR
    PR_REVIEW -. ERROR .-> ERROR
    CLEANUP -. ERROR .-> ERROR
    ERROR -. RETRY .-> PREVIOUS[PREVIOUS_STATUS]

    SETUP_APPROVAL -. CANCEL .-> CANCELED[CANCELED]
    PR_REVIEW -. CANCEL .-> CANCELED
